{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025@rel:R19-11#baf61a5a","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","release":"R19-11","content":"Depending on FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured (ECUC_FrTSyn_00013 : ) the OFS message shall be of type: FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured OFS CRC_NOT_SUPPORTED 0x34 OFS not CRC secured message CRC_SUPPORTED 0x44 OFS CRC secured message","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-15T00:12:06+00:00","cleaning":{"rule":"spec-text-clean@1","raw_sha256":"baf61a5a1de62de5a9ae1aa2dffce967e0de7e065c9314617dc26364b18fbbce","removed":["Specification of Time Synchronization over FlexRay AUTOSAR CP R19-11 21 of 66 Document ID 675: AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay - AUTOSAR confidential -"]},"text_key":"9d2f2cea502d"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025@rel:R20-11#11a0fc8e","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","release":"R20-11","content":"Depending on FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured (ECUC_FrTSyn_00013 : ) the OFS message shall be of type: FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured OFS CRC_NOT_SUPPORTED 0x34 OFS not CRC secured message CRC_SUPPORTED 0x44 OFS CRC secured message","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-15T00:10:07+00:00","text_key":"9d2f2cea502d"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025@rel:R21-11#e6bbd2f5","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","release":"R21-11","content":"Depending on FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured the OFS message shall be of type: FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured Value OFS Message Type CRC_NOT_SUPPORTED 0x34 OFS not CRC secured message CRC_SUPPORTED 0x44 OFS CRC secured message Table 7.6","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:13:07+00:00","text_key":"2973e53855bf"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025@rel:R22-11#2c4f615d","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","release":"R22-11","content":"If the FrTSynGlobalTimeTxIcvSecured is configured to ICV_NOT_SUPPORTED the message type of the OFS message depend on FrTSyn- GlobalTimeTxCrcSecured as follows: FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured Value OFS Message Type CRC_NOT_SUPPORTED 0x34 OFS not CRC secured message CRC_SUPPORTED 0x44 OFS CRC secured message Table 7.3: Settings of FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured for OFS messages without ICV","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-15T00:05:36+00:00","text_key":"a7a77970fad4","rejoin":{"rule":"text-rejoin@1","e":[[123,2,""]]}},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025@rel:R23-11#af4a1c7d","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","release":"R23-11","content":"If • FrTSynGlobalTimeTxIcvSecured is set to ICV_NOT_SUPPORTED • and FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured is set to CRC_NOT_SUPPORTED then the message type of the OFS message shall be 0x34 (i.e., OFS message not CRC protected and not ICV authenticated) If • FrTSynGlobalTimeTxIcvSecured is set to ICV_NOT_SUPPORTED • and FrTSynGlobalTimeTxCrcSecured is set to CRC_SUPPORTED then the message type of the OFS message shall be 0x44 (i.e., OFS message CRC protected and ICV not authenticated)","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-14T23:58:43+00:00","cleaning":{"rule":"spec-text-clean@1","raw_sha256":"af4a1c7d93f5a3cd046e49680f0affe93f09cd957a7e496bafb2b3ed11e3321e","removed":["28 of 104 Document ID 675: AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay Specification of Time Synchronization over FlexRay AUTOSAR CP R23-11"]},"text_key":"74a355f6ee03"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_FrTSyn_00025","is_dropped":true,"first_active_release":"R19-11","last_active_release":"R23-11","dropped_in":["R2